ication/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":97770037,"digest":"sha256:cb5d08792c41b1240fb547099ace3227ba1931761a14b0fcdefd92f96160b7bf","download_count":439,"created_at":"2026-10-02T06:18:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T06:18:58Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/stoplightio/spectral/releases/download/v6.17.0/spectral.exe"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stoplightio/spectral/tarball/v6.17.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stoplightio/spectral/zipball/v6.17.0","body":"## What's Changed\r\n\r\n  ### ✨ Features\r\n  - **OpenAPI 3.2 support**: fixes OAS 3.2 schema validation and aligns it with 3.0/3.1 by @AnastasiiaSvietlova in #3033\r\n  - **AsyncAPI 3.1.0**: updated to the latest AsyncAPI version by @danielkocot in #3019\r\n\r\n  ### 🐛 Bug Fixes\r\n  - **rulesets:** restore null guard in `duplicated-entry-in-enum` (#2959) by @slegarraga in #2963\r\n  - **rulesets:** clarify the `operationId` URL validation message by @slegarraga in #3035\r\n  - **formatters:** include all results in markdown output by @slegarraga in #3039\r\n  - **formatters:** include ruleset-based `documentationUrl` in the github format by @ctreatma in #3063\r\n  - **core:** make JSON Schemas in `packages/core/src/ruleset/meta` valid by @jviotti in #2788\r\n  - **repo:** report download failures in `install.sh` by @Sunasuna24 in #3041\r\n\r\n  ### 🔒 Security\r\n  - **repo:** prevent script injection in the `release-docker` workflow by @kopernic-pl in #3024\r\n  - **repo:** pin actions and update workflow references by @kopernic-pl in #3025\r\n\r\n  ### 📚 Documentation\r\n  - Document default severity for builtin rules by @slegarraga in #3036\r\n  - Show how to extend builtin rulesets in the JS API by @slegarraga in #3037\r\n  - **cli:** note the `github-actions` formatter version requirement by @slegarraga in #3038\r\n  - Add Bank API to the readme by @erwinkramer in #2806\r\n\r\n  ### 🧰 Tooling & Maintenance\r\n  - Upgrade ESLint 8 → 10 with flat config migration by @kopernic-pl in #3021\r\n  - Upgrade TypeScript to 4.9.5 by @micryc in #3078\r\n  - Un-pin the rollup version range by @AnastasiiaSvietlova in #3042\r\n  - Drop Node.js 18 and 20 from the test matrix by @Patrycja-dz in #3053\r\n  - Remove `devcontainer.json` and Dockerfile by @kopernic-pl in #3061\r\n  - Add a minor release trigger by @micryc in #3079\r\n  - **test-harness:** Windows runner fixes by @micryc in #3074, #3075, #3076, #3077\r\n\r\n  ### 📦 Dependency Updates\r\n\r\n  **Direct bumps and upgrades**\r\n\r\n  | Package | Version | PR |\r\n  |---|---|---|\r\n  | `tmp` | 0.2.1 → 0.2.7 | #3018 |\r\n  | `ip-address` | 10.2.0 → 10.4.0 | #3029 |\r\n  | `ip-address` | 10.4.0 → 10.7.2 | #3071 |\r\n  | `brace-expansion` | 1.1.12 → 1.1.18 | #3011 |\r\n  | `socket.io-parser` | 4.2.4 → 4.2.7 | #3028 |\r\n  | `undici` | 6.24.1 → 6.28.0 | #3030 |\r\n  | `fast-uri` | 3.1.2 → 3.1.5 | #3031 |\r\n  | `fast-uri` | 3.1.5 → 3.1.7 | #3059 |\r\n  | `js-yaml` | 3.14.2 → 3.15.1 | #3034 |\r\n  | `engine.io` | 6.6.2 → 6.6.9 | #3012 |\r\n  | `node-tar` | 7.5.11 → 7.5.21 | #3043 |\r\n  | `minimatch` | 3.1.2 → 3.1.5 | #3049 |\r\n  | `form-data` | 4.0.4 → 4.0.6 | #2973 |\r\n  | `sigstore` | 4.1.0 → 4.1.1 | #3057 |\r\n  | `@babel/core` | 7.18.9 → 7.29.7 | #2974 |\r\n  | `browserslist` | 4.21.3 → 4.28.8 | #3060 |\r\n  | `postcss-selector-parser` | 7.1.1 → 7.1.5 | #3058 |\r\n\r\n  **Bumped via resolutions**\r\n\r\n  | Package | Version | PR |\r\n  |---|---|---|\r\n  | `qs` | 6.15.3 | #3046 |\r\n  | `minimatch` | 5.1.9 | #3050 |\r\n  | `brace-expansion` | 2.1.4 and 5.0.9 | #3055 |\r\n  | `js-yaml` | 4.3.1 | #3048 |\r\n  | `ajv` | 8.20.0 | #3047 |\r\n  | `undici` | 7.29.0 | #3052 |\r\n\r\n  ## 🎉 New Contributors\r\n  Welcome, and thank you for your first contributions:\r\n  - @AnastasiiaSvietlova in #3042\r\n  - @danielkocot in #3019\r\n  - @Sunasuna24 in #3041\r\n  - @erwinkramer in #2806\r\n  - @jviotti in #2788\r\n  - @ctreatma in #3063\r\n\r\n  **Full Changelog**: https://github.com/stoplightio/spectral/compare/v6.16.3...v6.17.0","mentions_count":10}